  "uncertain": [
    "The back sticker also labels an I2C port (GND, 3V3, SDA 11, SCL 10) and a UART port (GND, 3V3, TX 43, RX 44), but the physical connectors are only faint openings at the bottom of the enclosure with no visible pin positions; they were not transcribed."
  ],
  "notes": "Both images show the same artwork at different resolutions; each transcribed separately. Positions and names taken from the numbered pin table beside the device; callouts printed as 'RXD(GPIO44)', 'DN(GPIO19)' etc. recorded with the GPIO name as label. The back sticker repeats abbreviated names beside the header (E5-E8, 12, 13, RX, TX, G, 3V3, SDA, SCL, BAT; 9, 8, 7, 6, 4, 3, 1, 0, G, 3V3, 20, 19, G, 5V); not merged into pins. The image itself is mostly faded."
